      "id": "dish_recipetin_vietnamese_lemongrass_chicken",
      "name": "Vietnamese Lemongrass Chicken",
      "category": "Dinner",
      "cuisine": "Vietnamese",
      "servings": 4,
      "prepTimeMinutes": 15,
      "imageEmoji": "🍗",
      "imageUrl": "https://www.recipetineats.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/Vietnamese-Lemongrass-Chicken_9.jpg",
      "tags": ["Vietnamese", "Chicken", "Quick & Easy", "Skillet"],
      "instructions": "1. Finely grate or mince the lemongrass, garlic, and ginger.\n2. Combine lemongrass, garlic, ginger, soy sauce, fish sauce, and sugar in a bowl. Add the chicken thighs and toss to coat well.\n3. Heat oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.\n4. Cook the chicken for 4-5 minutes on each side until golden, caramelized, and cooked through.\n5. Serve over steamed rice with fresh cucumber and tomato slices.",
